evidence = "Task 6.52.2 is done at spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:260455, but its do_2 (:260463), touches (:260466), tests (:260467), build_cmd (:260469) and rollback (:260474) must replace tests/bridge/retired/test_retired_emergency_exit.py with tests/bridge/retired/test_retired_bridge_emergency_exit.py, whose unchanged test_emergency_exit_is_retired at tests/bridge/retired/test_retired_bridge_emergency_exit.py:4 follows the rename in commit 24446b7d8ca9752f78c6525794738f689b055d5c; commit a26369c7eda603cb28bcdd8cef55c35df7d248ee updated only planned_paths and verify_cmd, now at spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:260468 and spec/layerx-merge/spec.kvx:260470."
close_comment = "The emergency-exit retirement test is tests/bridge/retired/test_retired_bridge_emergency_exit.py, and its assertion is unchanged by the rename. The completed task's specification needs to use that path consistently in do_2, touches, tests, build_cmd and rollback."
